msgid ""
"This error can be identified without providing a Table Schema, but only "
"if the data has enough cells of the correct type in the column to infer "
"the intended type. :::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/full-list-of-table-errors-detected.md:152
msgid "Errors Requiring Metadata"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/full-list-of-table-errors-detected.md:154
msgid ""
"These errors can only be identified if a Table Dialect or Table Schema is"
" provided by editing the table’s metadata. The Table Schema defines the "
"structure of the data, including the type of each column. Table Schema "
"adds additional constraints to the data, which are used to validate the "
"data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/full-list-of-table-errors-detected.md:156
msgid "Extra column name"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/full-list-of-table-errors-detected.md:158
msgid ""
"This error occurs when **a header label in the data is not defined in the"
" Table Schema**. The Table Schema should define all the columns in the "
"data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/full-list-of-table-errors-detected.md:172
msgid "Missing column name"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/full-list-of-table-errors-detected.md:174
msgid ""
"This error occurs when **a column defined in the Table Schema is not "
"present in the header row**. The data should contain all the columns "
"defined in the Table Schema."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/full-list-of-table-errors-detected.md:189
msgid "Incorrect column name"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/full-list-of-table-errors-detected.md:191
msgid ""
"This error occurs when **the header label in the data does not match the "
"label defined in the Table Schema**. The header row should contain the "
"same labels as defined in the Table Schema."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/full-list-of-table-errors-detected.md:205
msgid "Primary Key Error"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/full-list-of-table-errors-detected.md:207
msgid ""
"This error occurs when the **primary key constraint defined in the Table "
"Schema is not satisfied**. The primary key constraint ensures that the "
"values in the specified columns are unique."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/full-list-of-table-errors-detected.md:222
msgid "Foreign Key Error"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/full-list-of-table-errors-detected.md:224
msgid ""
"This error occurs when the **foreign key constraint defined in the Table "
"Schema is not satisfied**. The foreign key constraint ensures that the "
"values in the specified columns are present in another table or satisfies"
" self-referencing constraint."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/full-list-of-table-errors-detected.md:242
msgid "Unique constraint error"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/full-list-of-table-errors-detected.md:244
msgid ""
"This error occurs when the **unique constraint defined in the Table "
"Schema is not satisfied**. The unique constraint ensures that the values "
"in the specified columns are unique."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/full-list-of-table-errors-detected.md:259
msgid "Constraint Error"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/full-list-of-table-errors-detected.md:261
msgid ""
"This error occurs when **a field constraint defined in the Table Schema "
"is not satisfied**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/full-list-of-table-errors-detected.md:263
msgid ""
"Read more about Table Schema constraints: "
"[https://datapackage.org/standard/table-schema/\\#field-"
"constraints](https://datapackage.org/standard/table-schema/#field-"
"constraints)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/full-list-of-table-errors-detected.md:279
msgid ""
"The following constraints can be defined in the Table Schema and are "
"currently supported by Open Data Editor (please read the section above "
"about unique constraints):"
msgstr ""

